    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Conservation of the Early 19th-Century Bath Hotel on Nevis</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Built around 1800, the elegant Bath Hotel once served the wealthy planters of Nevis and the Caribbean who flocked to its therapeutic hot spring waters. This project supports the conservation of the hotel and its adaptation for reuse by the community.</narrative>
    </description>
